       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TREE-PRUNING.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TREE-PRUNING-PROOFS.
           05  WS-RECURSIVE-PRUNING-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ROSS-ISLAND-CONSTRAINT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CYCLIC-NODE-BOUND-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-S-BAR-COMPLEMENTIZER-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIVERSAL-TREE-CLOSURE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PRUNING-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PRUNING-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PRUNING-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PRUNING-AND-ISLANDS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CYCLIC-AND-COMPLEMENTIZER.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRUNING-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PRUNING-AND-ISLANDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RECURSIVE-PRUNING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ROSS-ISLAND-CONSTRAINT.
       2000-EVALUATE-CYCLIC-AND-COMPLEMENTIZER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CYCLIC-NODE-BOUND-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-S-BAR-COMPLEMENTIZER-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRUNING-PROOFS.
           IF WS-RECURSIVE-PRUNING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ROSS-ISLAND-CONSTRAINT = 1 AND
              WS-CYCLIC-NODE-BOUND-OK = 1 AND
              WS-S-BAR-COMPLEMENTIZER-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-TREE-CLOSURE
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PRUNING-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PRUNING-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PRUNING-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PRUNING-CODE.
